{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_ce87ec39c6b34517970734b4be6dda69","id":"pg_70ef659b88835e1e9f50b800816393f9","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/agentforce314-clawcodex-feature-list-md-4706a57fc29f-b800816393f9.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_dd3bf0c003295617a21ba638b354be47"],"title":"agentforce314/clawcodex/FEATURE_LIST.md @ 4706a57fc29f","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ce87ec39c6b34517970734b4be6dda69"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_25363152c452bf19e2efff6645efd956dda603d3d67890705a6b148a13fcd562"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"clawcodex web serves the same agent in a browser at 127.0.0.1:8081 by default, mounting the web bundle on the serve process rather than running a second server, and binds loopback unless --allow-remote is passed."},{"claim_ids":["clm_374016996a4d2382d1e3d0ccb3ea5e011050353cd60b43d2faaeae96b0922d3e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The /eco mode compresses model-bound Bash output with deterministic filters (failure-focused summaries, ceremony stripping, dedup, head-caps), discards any compression not better than the raw rendering, and tees lossy output to disk with a recovery hint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3a041c22429b3f898fc6663f9bc8f495341370d26bd4840f4a588de114d90462"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Requests keep a byte-stable prefix so DeepSeek's prompt cache covers system, tools, and history across turns; /cost is stated to follow DeepSeek's peak/off-peak pricing schedule."},{"claim_ids":["clm_53902dd8776d89510703a7dd1bda9b61368e18f63af2b5d7f0d973d4b3f1227e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An /eco benchmark replayed 27 real captured command outputs through the production pipeline, measuring 92,989 to 17,767 tokens (-80%) with tiktoken cl100k_base counting; reproduction scripts are provided under eval/eco."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6340f4b40d39a6ebae702045c6865b9f3c824e9d12c7a3187aa4d03d2a2d2b74"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README marks MCP support as partial: tools are wired but the full client/runtime is still evolving, and roadmap phases 3-4 are in progress with phase 5 pending."},{"claim_ids":["clm_66878d1f6fee583094ae9c6151f3dcb479e003a46bb4700ec648826b1c1bc992"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repo-shipped .clawcodex/settings.json may only set defaultMode to default or dontAsk, and is ignored if looser than what would otherwise apply; administrators can disable Full Access via config or managed policy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7652b0d38c95dc1984745935570a94ebeb6206f5bdb5552daeb71599207824ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills are markdown SKILL.md slash commands with front matter supporting descriptions, allowed-tools limits, and named arguments, available at project and user scope."},{"claim_ids":["clm_79168ca2e27fe6ccb120922c70890011ca9f3f9a5ac7a19e6bd2f456999f5418"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Headless -p runs default to the 'default' permission mode; a saved Full Access setting dials headless down rather than up, and --dangerously-skip-permissions or --permission-mode can override per run."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7e43de4b7fb7ca21bff6665ba8ea2333da2ead8c78ccaeb2df3cc93f6c3fa145"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A native desktop app (clawcodex desktop) shares the same backend, config, and session store as the CLI/TUI, booting its own backend via clawcodex serve with loopback HTTP and WebSocket gateway."},{"claim_ids":["clm_89193ffc48b5cc932f30f17491e81c404bdadc81f538f16036743e039e7772da"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product exposes a CLI with subcommands including tui, web, login, logout, config, and --version, plus a headless -p/--print mode for non-interactive runs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_93c86f2ea07832d91898efac8f6deadeda74daf039e17593bae5f99b0781601c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Interactive sessions start in Full Access by default; /permissions offers Ask-for-approval, Approve-for-me, and Full Access levels, saved to permissions.defaultMode in ~/.clawcodex/settings.json."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c79820599b47901ecaf86d19b08f1f1c08c90782a6a2f78dfbac736a84f7524f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Headless runs support --output-format json and stream-json output with stream-json input, plus per-run overrides like --provider, --model, --max-turns, and --allowed-tools."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cd8e59df63c9985e56a68be3ab6edab7b4cb77583fa2d97b90df7199eaa7da93"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The interactive UI is a TypeScript Ink TUI that spawns a Python agent-server child and communicates over an NDJSON pipe; running clawcodex with no mode flags launches it."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d3a4e56397ed1074775915d9272892e82c7c6af80c816538cf40010a0dab808c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool system implements file operations (Read/Write/Edit/Glob/Grep), Bash, WebFetch/WebSearch, task management, agent tools, and configuration tools; MCP tools are wired but the full client/runtime is still evolving."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dad4471422640d70dc5d7332b0f51f110adc65e0dda3e27001cd915b2706cf6c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime targets Python 3.10+ and lists roughly 30 LLM providers including native formats (Anthropic, DeepSeek, Gemini, OpenAI), OpenAI-compatible vendors, and local servers (Ollama, vLLM, SGLang) requiring no API key."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f35e9bc0609b7279d2048abd6c2481ca26394699048b8a75c0409ec6b2f67234"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The WebSearch tool requires a Tavily API key (TAVILY_API_KEY), configurable in the env block of ~/.clawcodex/config.json."}],"claim_ids":["clm_25363152c452bf19e2efff6645efd956dda603d3d67890705a6b148a13fcd562","clm_374016996a4d2382d1e3d0ccb3ea5e011050353cd60b43d2faaeae96b0922d3e","clm_3a041c22429b3f898fc6663f9bc8f495341370d26bd4840f4a588de114d90462","clm_53902dd8776d89510703a7dd1bda9b61368e18f63af2b5d7f0d973d4b3f1227e","clm_6340f4b40d39a6ebae702045c6865b9f3c824e9d12c7a3187aa4d03d2a2d2b74","clm_66878d1f6fee583094ae9c6151f3dcb479e003a46bb4700ec648826b1c1bc992","clm_7652b0d38c95dc1984745935570a94ebeb6206f5bdb5552daeb71599207824ba","clm_79168ca2e27fe6ccb120922c70890011ca9f3f9a5ac7a19e6bd2f456999f5418","clm_7e43de4b7fb7ca21bff6665ba8ea2333da2ead8c78ccaeb2df3cc93f6c3fa145","clm_89193ffc48b5cc932f30f17491e81c404bdadc81f538f16036743e039e7772da","clm_93c86f2ea07832d91898efac8f6deadeda74daf039e17593bae5f99b0781601c","clm_c79820599b47901ecaf86d19b08f1f1c08c90782a6a2f78dfbac736a84f7524f","clm_cd8e59df63c9985e56a68be3ab6edab7b4cb77583fa2d97b90df7199eaa7da93","clm_d3a4e56397ed1074775915